{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53034","headline":"大历年浙东联唱集 自云门还泛若耶入镜湖寄院中诸公 · 浙东衆诗人","name":"大历年浙东联唱集 自云门还泛若耶入镜湖寄院中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（谢良弼吕渭郑槩严维裴晃陈允初萧幼和〖不详〗）山中秋赏罢，溪上晚归时。\n（谢良弼）出谷秦人望，经湖谢客期。\n（吕渭）日斜愁路远，风横畏舟迟。\n（郑槩）章句怀文友，途程问檝师。\n（严维）浅沙游蚌蛤，危石起鸬鷀。\n（裴晃）落叶飞孤戍，横塘向古祠。\n（允初）行行多兴逸，无处不相思。\n（萧幼和）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"浙东衆诗人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}